<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Inquiry Received - Stable Partners</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            margin: 0; 
            padding: 0; 
            background-color: #ffffff; 
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #000000;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 60px 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 520px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .header {
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
        }
        .content h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.1;
            letter-spacing: -0.02em;
            margin: 0 0 24px 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .content p {
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            color: #404040;
        }
        .accent-box {
            background-color: #f8f8f8;
            border: 1px solid #e5e5e5;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        .accent-box h2 {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
            color: #000000;
        }
        .footer {
            margin-top: 60px;
            font-size: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            color: #a3a3a3;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="header">
                <div class="logo">Stable Partners</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="content">
                <h1>Request<br>Acknowledged.</h1>
                <p>Hello <%= locals.name %>,</p>
                <p>Thank you for initiating a consultation with Stable Partners. Your inquiry regarding property management and asset growth has been received by our management desk.</p>
                
                <div class="accent-box">
                    <h2>Next Protocol</h2>
                    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px;">A dedicated consultant is currently reviewing your request. You will receive a direct response or a meeting invitation within 24 business hours.</p>
                </div>

                <p>If you have any immediate documentation to provide, please reply directly to this transmission.</p>
                
                <p>Best regards,<br><strong>Stable Partners Management</strong></p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer">
                &copy; 2026 STABLE PARTNERS. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
